### Create tournament
POST {{baseUrl}}tournaments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Dhaka Premier League",
  "venue": "Mirpur Stadium",
  "overs": 20,
  "type": "application",
  "description": "Best tournament in Dhaka"
}

### List all tournaments
GET {{baseUrl}}tournaments

### Get tournament by id
GET {{baseUrl}}tournaments/1

### Apply to tournament
POST {{baseUrl}}tournaments/1/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "teamId": 1
}

### Invite team
POST {{baseUrl}}tournaments/1/invite/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Approve team
PUT {{baseUrl}}tournaments/1/teams/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "status": "confirmed"
}

### Add manager
POST {{baseUrl}}tournaments/1/managers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "playerId": 1
}

### Remove manager
DELETE {{baseUrl}}tournaments/1/managers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}